WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.140
 What's up, Marvel fans?

00:00:01.140 --> 00:00:03.930
We're here with Jon Watts,
the director, and family.

00:00:03.930 --> 00:00:06.060
So Jon is an incredibly
incredible director.

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:07.680
We've seen two Spider-Man
movies already.

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:09.795
What makes him so amazing?

00:00:09.795 --> 00:00:11.250
 That's a tip.

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:12.600
 Uh.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:13.440
Well, he's our brother.

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:14.670
 He's our baby brother.

00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:15.780
Yeah, he's our baby brother.

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:18.430
 I wanted to bring my
family on the red carpet.

00:00:18.430 --> 00:00:21.510
just because, historically,
Spider-Man's out

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:23.560
there helping regular people.

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:24.360
That's what he does.

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:27.210
And my family
literally does that.

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:29.250
My brother is a firefighter,
my sister's a nurse,

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:31.380
my other sister
here is a teacher.

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:33.000
And they're like
actually out there

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.060
on the front lines
legitimately helping

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:38.500
people over this past
terrible year and a half.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:41.490
So I just wanted to sort of take
a little bit of the spotlight

00:00:41.490 --> 00:00:43.590
off of me and shine it on them
and all the people that have

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:46.255
been doing great things to
help people in this really

00:00:46.255 --> 00:00:47.055
tough couple of years.

00:00:47.055 --> 00:00:48.210
 That's amazing.

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:49.860
 That's incredible.

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:50.810
 That's your answer.

00:00:50.810 --> 00:00:51.610
 That's the answer.

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:55.100
 So Jon just spoke about
how you inspire him,

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:57.360
how does he inspire you?

00:00:57.360 --> 00:00:58.475
 Oh my goodness.

00:00:58.475 --> 00:01:00.290
 I bring them to
red carpet events.

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:01.880
[LAUGHTER]

00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:04.040
They get to meet Tom
Holland and Zendaya.

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:06.500
 Now, this is a
huge, huge film.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:07.820
Where did you even begin?

00:01:07.820 --> 00:01:09.900
 Well, at the end
of the last movie,

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:15.320
we kind of gave ourselves
a really big ending where

00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:16.760
we revealed Peter's identity.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.370
So we started there.

00:01:19.370 --> 00:01:20.750
 Straight to the
point, I love it.

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:23.180
 Now, super villains
from previous Spider-Man

00:01:23.180 --> 00:01:24.290
movies are in this film.

00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:26.235
 He's just like standing here.

00:01:26.235 --> 00:01:27.035
This is really fun.

00:01:27.035 --> 00:01:29.460
 Well, what was it like
to be a part of that?

00:01:29.460 --> 00:01:30.260
 Oh, it was great.

00:01:30.260 --> 00:01:32.120
I mean, I'm a fan
of those movies.

00:01:32.120 --> 00:01:35.300
So to have them there,
I was just being

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:36.740
a nerd like everyone else.

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:40.990
[MUSIC PLAYING]

